# Echoes of the Broken Sun — repository ignore rules
# Author and owner: Angelis Pseftis
#
# `main` is published publicly. Nothing machine-local, credential-bearing,
# regenerable, or AI-session-specific belongs in a commit. The owner-authored
# agent contract (AGENTS.md, the client entry points, .opencode/skills) is
# tracked deliberately and is re-included explicitly at the end of the AI block.
#
# core.ignorecase is true on macOS: keep patterns specific so a generic rule
# cannot swallow a tracked path such as Build/Mac/Resources.

# ── macOS, editors, IDEs ──────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.fseventsd
.idea/
.vscode/
*.code-workspace
.vs/
.zed/
.fleet/
.history/
*.swp
*~

# ── Unreal generated and machine-local build state ────────────────────
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
*.VC.db
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.sln
*.suo
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace
.build/
*.dSYM/
Build/Mac/FileOpenOrder/
Build/Mac/*.PackageVersionCounter
Build/Receipts/
Config/DefaultEngine.ini.local
Config/*.local.ini
Content/Data/Generated/

# ── Evidence, packages, local worktrees ───────────────────────────────
BuildArtifacts/*
!BuildArtifacts/.gitkeep
Worktrees/*
Packages/
*.dmg
*.pkg
*.ipa
*.zip
*.7z
*.tar.gz

# ── Credentials, signing material, private configuration ──────────────
.env
.env.*
*.p12
*.pfx
*.cer
*.crt
*.pem
*.key
*.keystore
*.jks
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile
AuthKey_*.p8
*.keychain
*.keychain-db
.netrc
.npmrc
.pypirc
secrets.json
credentials.json
service-account*.json
notarytool-*.json
app-store-connect*.json

# ── Language and tool caches, logs, merge residue ─────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
.next/
.turbo/
.vercel/
.pnpm-store/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
*.log
*.pid
*.tmp
*.orig
*.rej

# ── AI assistant and agent tooling ────────────────────────────────────
# Local settings, session state, transcripts, caches and per-machine service
# bindings for every assistant, present or future. These are per-machine
# artifacts of how the work was done, not part of the game or its contract.
.claude/*
.claude.json
CLAUDE.local.md
.codex/
.openai/
.gemini/
GEMINI.local.md
.antigravity/
.copilot/
.github/copilot-*.local.md
.cursor/
.cursorrules.local
.windsurf/
.windsurfrules.local
.cline/
.clinerules.local
.roo/
.roomodes
.aider*
.continue/
.cody/
.sourcegraph/
.codeium/
.tabnine/
.devin/
.sweep/
.opencode/*
AGENTS.local.md
.mcp.local.json
mcp.local.json
ai-transcripts/
agent-sessions/
*.aiconversation

# Local model weights and AI runtime data are never pushed.
LocalAI/
LocalCache/
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth
*.onnx

# Owner-authored agent contract — tracked deliberately, keep these visible.
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
!GEMINI.md
!.mcp.json
!.claude/skills
!.claude/settings.json
!.agents/skills
!.opencode/skills/
